# textdomain: dw_core
# Croatian translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

SCORE @1=BODOVI @1
Gamepad: PS4/PS5 DualShock needs Settings -> Controls -> Gamepads -> Joystick type @= ps5. Xbox works on 'auto'. See GAMEPAD.md.=Gamepad: PS4/PS5 DualShock treba Postavke -> Kontrole -> Gamepadi -> Vrsta joysticka @= ps5. Xbox radi na 'auto'. Vidi GAMEPAD.md.
Toggle the fullscreen world map=Uključi/isključi kartu svijeta preko cijelog zaslona
Player not found=Igrač nije pronađen
Spore Block=Blok spora
Magma Block=Blok magme
Ice Crystal=Ledeni kristal
Dead Stone=Mrtvi kamen
Embers=Žar
Ash=Pepeo
Mud=Blato
Glowing Crystal=Svjetleći kristal
Basalt=Bazalt
Mossy Stone=Mahovinasti kamen
HARE WAITING — catch up!=ZEC ČEKA — sustigni ga!
HARE AT THE FINISH — fly to it!=ZEC JE NA CILJU — leti do njega!
SLALOM! Stay on the hare=SLALOM! Drži se zeca
HARE: BARREL ROLL! (double-tap A/D)=ZEC: BARREL ROLL! (dvostruki dodir A/D)
HARD TURN! S+A/D @= airbrake drift=OŠTAR ZAOKRET! S+A/D @= drift sa zračnom kočnicom
TUNNEL! Slow down (S) and fly clean=TUNEL! Uspori (S) i leti precizno
CLIMB + DIVE! Shift down for extra speed=PENJANJE + PONIRANJE! Shift dolje za dodatnu brzinu
FINISH — @1  |  SCORE @2=CILJ — @1  |  BODOVI @2
Race finished in @1! Checkpoints @2/@3, score @4.=Utrka završena za @1! Kontrolne točke @2/@3, bodovi @4.
Race failed — fighter destroyed.=Utrka neuspješna — lovac uništen.
Greyhound race — chase the golden hare! /race stop cancels it=Utrka hrtova — lovi zlatnog zeca! /race stop je prekida
Race cancelled.=Utrka prekinuta.
No race is running.=Nijedna utrka nije u tijeku.
A race is already running — end it with /race stop.=Utrka je već u tijeku — završi je s /race stop.
You are not in a fighter.=Nisi u lovcu.
Could not spawn the hare.=Zeca nije bilo moguće stvoriti.
RACE! Follow the golden hare!=UTRKA! Prati zlatnog zeca!
Race started — follow the hare!=Utrka je počela — prati zeca!
HARE @1 m  ·  CP @2/@3=ZEC @1 m  ·  CP @2/@3
Welcome to DoggioWars! You ARE the fighter — fly!=Dobro došao u DoggioWars! TI SI lovac — leti!
Toggle the island radar (minimap)=Uključi/isključi radar otoka (mini kartu)
Radar OFF.=Radar ISKLJUČEN.
Radar ON.=Radar UKLJUČEN.
BARREL ROLL!=BARREL ROLL!
LOOPING!=LOOPING!
IMMELMANN!=IMMELMANN!
BOOST!=BOOST!
Fighter destroyed! Respawning...=Lovac uništen! Ponovno stvaranje...
Debug: respawn your fighter at your position=Debug: ponovno stvori lovca na tvom položaju
Fighter respawned!=Lovac ponovno stvoren!
Fly to the nearest island; /island <biome> @= nearest of that biome=Leti do najbližeg otoka; /island <biom> @= najbliži otok tog bioma
Unknown biome '@1' (or none nearby). Biomes: @2=Nepoznat biom '@1' (ili nijedan u blizini). Biomi: @2
@1 island at (@2, @3, @4), r@=@5, @6 blocks away - it is right in front of you. Give it a moment to generate.=Otok @1 na (@2, @3, @4), r@=@5, udaljen @6 blokova — točno je ispred tebe. Pričekaj trenutak da se generira.
@1 island, r@=@2, was @3 blocks away - it is in front of you. Give it a moment to generate.=Otok @1, r@=@2, bio je udaljen @3 blokova — ispred tebe je. Pričekaj trenutak da se generira.
Moving to island.=Premještanje na otok.
Fly above coordinates: /goto <x> <z> or /goto <x> <y> <z>=Leti iznad koordinata: /goto <x> <z> ili /goto <x> <y> <z>
Usage: /goto <x> <z> or /goto <x> <y> <z>=Upotreba: /goto <x> <z> ili /goto <x> <y> <z>
Flying to (@1, @2, @3).=Letim prema (@1, @2, @3).
Fly to the home island at the world origin=Leti na matični otok u ishodištu svijeta
Flying to the home island (0,0) - it will be in front of you.=Letim na matični otok (0,0) — bit će ispred tebe.
Gamepad diagnostics: live view of sticks and pressed buttons=Dijagnostika gamepada: prikaz palica i pritisnutih tipki uživo
Gamepad diagnostics ON — press buttons and move the sticks, and watch what lights up mid-screen.=Dijagnostika gamepada UKLJUČENA — pritišći tipke, pomiči palice i gledaj što zasvijetli na sredini zaslona.
Gamepad diagnostics OFF.=Dijagnostika gamepada ISKLJUČENA.
Switch controls: fighter <-> submarine=Promijeni upravljanje: lovac <-> podmornica
SUBMARINE: left stick @= thrust/strafe, look @= heading, X @= up, O @= down. Tricks and boost are off.=PODMORNICA: lijeva palica @= potisak/bočni pomak, pogled @= smjer, X @= gore, O @= dolje. Manevri i boost su isključeni.
FIGHTER: classic flight controls.=LOVAC: klasično upravljanje letom.
CHECKPOINT @1/@2=KONTROLNA TOČKA @1/@2
